----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[PASS] density decreases monotonically over 800-1000 K (2304.7 -> 2202.1 kg/m3)
[PASS] viscosity decreases monotonically over 800-1000 K (14.885 -> 5.351 cP)
[PASS] all four properties positive over the whole grid

Prandtl number over the grid: 7.3 to 20.3 (10.3 at 922 K)
Reported because cp, mu and k reach the model only through Pr and Re; a property error
that leaves Pr unchanged does not move the heat transfer.

